      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Verbank%2C_New_York"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Early Verbank hosted two gristmills and a paper mill, reflecting its agricultural and industrial roots.",
